2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,
(a)
"Act" means the National Commission for Minorities Act, 1992 (
19 of 1992
);
(b)
Audit Officer" means the Comptroller and Auditor General of India or any person appointed by him in connection with the
audit of the accounts of the Commission;
(c)
"Commission" means the National Commission for Minorities constituted under Section 3 of the Act;
(d)
"Financial Year" means the year beginning on the 1st of April and ending on 31st of March following;
(e)
"Form" means Form annexed to these rules.
